"below it. Many CPUs do not go below a certain speed once they have work to "
"do, however low the maximum is (an Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX keeps about 2.2 "
"GHz on its P-cores and 1.5 GHz on its E-cores). Maximums below that change "
"little; higher ones are kept exactly."
